 167:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_pmp.c **** /*-------------------------------------------------------------------------*//**
 168:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_pmp.c ****   Please note the first four PMP's are set to zero by MSS Configurator v2021.1
 169:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_pmp.c ****   These will need to be set by the HSS. The first three relate to HSS footprint
 170:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_pmp.c ****   The PMP4 is used to open a hole for debug region.
 171:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_pmp.c **** 
 172:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_pmp.c ****   | PMP | cfg  | L  | XWR | Detail                                             |
 173:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_pmp.c ****   |-----|-----------|-----|----------------------------------------------------|
 174:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_pmp.c ****   |  0  | 0x18 | N  |     | 256KB | Closes access for s and U mode             |
 175:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_pmp.c ****   |  1  | 0x98 | Y  | X R | 256KB | Opens up area for m-mode only              |
 176:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_pmp.c ****   |  2  | 0x98 | Y  | XRW |  64KB | OpenSBI scratch per scratch                |
 177:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_pmp.c ****   |  3  | 0x98 | Y  | XRW |   4KB | Open window for debug                      |
 178:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_pmp.c ****   |  .. | ..   | .. | ..  |  ..   | ..                                         |
 179:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_pmp.c ****   |  15 | 0x18 | Y  |     |   -   | Close everything not opened                |
 180:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_pmp.c **** 
 181:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_pmp.c ****  @param pmp0cfg return with config for first four PMP's
 182:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_pmp.c **** 
 183:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/mss_pmp.c ****  */
